
@body = http://localhost:3000

### Cria um professor ( precisa de autenticação)
POST {{body}}/managers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Ceo",
    "password": "true"
}

### Patcheia um novo profesor 
PATCH {{body}}/managers/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Ceo of Fire",
    "password": "butifyoucloseyoureyes"
}

####
POST http://localhost:3001/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Ceo of Fire",
    "role": "ADMIN",
    "password": "jojoba"
}


### Get todos professores
GET {{body}}/managers

### Get 1 professor
GET {{body}}/managers/1

### Mata um user
DELETE {{body}}/managers/1
